      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8ff5482fb785b36577c0fac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa46660bfc0ae9e050fe09d34fc6f31d98e8b6d50f3327bbece070ee2852f743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31718f7ee555decefde14526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，训练员？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a8d5efde813ef7ca5a05f331068f377b701d1246b874e32add4acec94ffab0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:930415c1cc81153cc66e33bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f660ccb0f5cbab55c45dd39f2fc91bd8ffaddc5268ccc8ee347e1c8071fd5cfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e7a89ae23eb0543bd2c3fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，啊啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72a337c662ea77461df50f59ebf3d5e410e45165ecd84a4255b92b9b04ee319",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7e2d253faa8f86c8f9e4ad2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天也在这里。很期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cec6d8e1085dce06b5f62d20ad44083a163589b33c9dc22caa2ad4a7794491b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7af94967ffec4f9b565976e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…稍微，有点摇晃…没问题。\n我已经习惯这样的事了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd930dbc2a6dc767bd03948c1ccd9fbe44f6ba547dd1eb869133340a426b5626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3932ccd2f5ede4634c691b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能气馁…\n必须忍耐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34f9954a43e535d024a535121ec578d3d4849afae76f6c4e2aaac82e88b9d57b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c92397e524d65ef2356102e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道为何，现在的话\n能跑到任何地方。…嗯，我想\n跑一下。向着极限的另一边…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4792f1fe8a68d75ceaa18d2caf5252c11cc84b60f2168365ab48047961297e4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c2a049c7315cb5f20c7ab2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一分，一秒，一瞬间…\n我感觉自己能仔细地集中精神。\n这样的话，一定…",
      "source_fingerprint": "82b218dd6e1a49afe3b1536955065599b45834b4f9d11f62e72905d05e5f283a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:899fa5290e69cf3af7bb2cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1、2、3…呼。\n体温，心跳，肌肉状态都很好。\n那么今天做什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a04ead19be0a78fe4447ee484de089ca6fd6e77608f90a8b771ce61b3f5adf28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f5a6c44af858bfe757170fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚的状态很好。\n能够全力训练…\n光是这样就让人感到无比爽快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d323039f84537653a94b035ada1ef0a12547c46b44154e4838143324eed7ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfc9066bbbb85e290fdffcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『和往常一样』的一天，对我来说\n是最好的…但『现在』必须\n朝着更高的目标前进，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "678cbea2a9058f3f2f6a13b6c7c4d0125260f3c730e2a689d9700c969a2e7d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43aa65b11bcdb2653786057b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "珍惜每一个瞬间…\n让我们用心进行细致的训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce28a2e588b137310283e7aa35a2e3fd73909629ea536c4d0a2becdac99cacac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b110486933185b12217403b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然脚步很重…但是，\n这种程度就受挫折是不行的。\n请相信我…所积累的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1ff900879c9ac48cd6f7c2f70cc1815dcb0914d2b0d222418d3a577b218865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b0327a45e8cfca85f5cccf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…也有这样的日子呢。\n不要着急…一起喝杯茶，\n放松一下吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a08c0103e214ebba8adbe3b4d13b617181894be5b1308e8327e1b10c532ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabf11a4f652122fcda86358",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员…根据今天的\n综合考虑…可能需要修改…\n训练目录…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d27b7c4cf7011e9c7d0e6367a9c5b76b4782eac618e150bf07e7755ff54eeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42eab9eab71ed642a788241",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我，能留下活过的轨迹了吗。\n…不，焦虑是大忌。深呼吸…\n冷静下来，深呼吸…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f255762294ddcb55891d095148f678626484e49a27e28665a56abc0a8648bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbf232c614064f6e1c9cac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着急的话会把事情搞砸。\n…现在这个时候，\n真的该乱来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "613dbb725adf62cc55f2bbffd60b2a931ba709b90069a664f1293ae93b246a31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9736e8a847a57a38f93aff8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "觉悟和鲁莽是不同的。\n再勉强的话，到底能得到什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "036b5c7f80e023ac5ca84f68865f3073c499c9dc4689fed78b4989d0229a8709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87565acb45e4d9c7c6b95561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只需要不断地前进，前进。\n我的一切都是为了这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fdc5d4d4be44776ed04d1f6bcb88631dce0b572c9ae7b1a9f5e819b7dd981df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b16a2ee8447e422c5c11f380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请，好好看着。\n我最好的奔跑，最棒的光辉…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dc44939a12184d1a63b53f68577ddaeaa4a2c133b806da8bf5dc122f818f3ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486da4c7e7bdce88acc5442f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知己知彼百战不殆。\n要重新审视自己和对手…才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3405c39a08edb055bb7c1c67440a91f8e26643ab70b2d539531a90dd08a19825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df5eae8ee0fbb831b92a191c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "长期钻研，长期修炼。\n所有的一切，都是为了这一瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "003fc06483b6cebe0d06d9611cd27808242e9e46b84875e63be94d6794959eb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb22f91e9b1c62e74157a0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这高昂的心情…过去的\n伟人们也有同样的心情吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8b30d2c93cb88b2ea33382742264c700fb57426b2b94c232d9a17659fad698",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6dd5ccfbbadae729828f3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，\n请在胜者台上等我回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "051f6c73233c815ef85dd464eb0f734d80df3186d3bb07cc89479343ce315906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158a5719289c52028cca5011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来就和往常一样，\n竭尽全力。让你看看现在的我",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f345fddec5a2f3dd615c884c700bd44bcc015a8f00b08a3f7a22c448c6b2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5b89c1bbae96e45dcaeeeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有负面因素…\n呵呵，对我来说\n这已经足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "847eff16782151484ed9fca0b75caa33b5827dba405d5bcd518412cbdc0443db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fdc75d583572b420dc1d15c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认真地，一个一个地。\n相信迄今为止努力的成果。\n…我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd5b288e0daf9fcae3ed2dee9cb6d6d1d81aef17f52affebecf76e15835b2093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb26f48771433df593a531e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中…集中…\n没关系，这种程度的不适…\n不管多少次都能克服的",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c119d37379704eb1e620b12c48e18b1c96c65b99999017bac84a6cb5bcb9d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7163a2a3857f9d5f80f7a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有准备万全的时候。\n那就是比赛吗。\n一起…跨越这堵墙吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b26773fc7f9537df53317e4438e113102c71237343351a83536ab322d82fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641c2522d33dcbbafb0c96d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有在逆境的时候，才会显现\n出那个人的本质…『现在』就\n必须要展现出这样的觉悟了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "103b9519e914656aafa86b332242fb97935f56de49ed840c630e9a366313a3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c7ba61a37a3128a2578dfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…我不会说泄气话。\n现在，我也要在这种状态下，\n认真地做好每一件事…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4047460cff6fd2a41942c4f6cb42d236cae2223a5ab33836d8c25f7a9e365eb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f737c29d7ed6e7cf5fc4467",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇猛果断地。\n一起克服这个逆境吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e7338dffdfc292a2e3eef5094b373ce5a9c941a945f7522b8e19c26b86c2c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7321ef546854451cc603511d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会在这样的地方\n结束的…绝对，\n不会结束…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2592d2b42d51e21c43cf6838f039b3d4de6ccdb9e191fb795965881dfdc78dd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf53b33467496b314f7553a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc23146efaa5b9bd82b5ca6bacba270ace6a87e0a701ce2e285077510313307c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d3a8c75ca6019d3942e0df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3552110edd088c0c520b85856d9fabcfbee62b360b737768e6bcc01b89ebb801",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:121c9d5d6b1c82cb14dc8988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4751dd24b1cc01c018d0bfc5e41666107f225b47c76b137af696c4a8217995a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dad082542fccd7679729b65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此！",
      "source_fingerprint": "896323a1a6877415e0f5a700b71c4bdebd2279e38fc2b32b248c5224f5ef1c58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a293c963193e5b2b887cb310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "056da68bc7170ef8be1cb179ee971e3aac4bee141af427e8740afe932086bca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c52cbe531e05760e8e7459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不争气…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb12b6e1a11638d7afba80d08ef1a133b29787d7038abcc99ee23c20e9fdb17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e561c3a8b082d31db503879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff9bea766428a229b8a948dd52c6bae70e13dd23ca82a2db4936fb00888120c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b522dc2c474f49c8bbec1ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情很好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fc0b7131ebfd1ddb128d48ce99bd9b866e7e17c462dcd97930cfb59dd4e3eef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28e19df222beb87cdf455841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "041792eb1db64a7c15e372aef3061641a0085b687950c8a6cba25a577a9f4b86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ce0b7f242ed5109dd04887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b170be6932eb234489b3ae1b5349a861e7d50c9c201e2c7e680e1cfe37f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36a63533ba9f9054334d9baa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02a29804f579352b69497ce4e7d4760ac5217dab04cd9dfc63e276e27aac89a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:297293117b1eeb65459c3d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd96f357ba5430a69a6f82f455fe84c05f9ffa2b4540d9129fa869f2fa6fbda2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "2030"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
